### ============================================================
### Workout Logger API - REST Client Tests
### Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code to run these
### Set @baseUrl and @token variables before running
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = PASTE_YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================================
### AUTH SERVICE
### ============================================================

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "saif_test",
  "email": "saif@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saif@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get current user profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### EXERCISE MANAGEMENT SERVICE (Eyad)
### ============================================================

### Get all exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get exercises with search filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises?search=bench&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get exercises by muscle group via query param
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises?muscleGroup=chest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get exercises by muscle group (dedicated route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/muscle/legs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a custom exercise
# @name createExercise
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barbell Squat",
  "muscleGroup": "legs",
  "description": "A compound lower-body exercise targeting the quads, hamstrings, and glutes."
}

###

### Get single exercise by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update an exercise
PUT {{baseUrl}}/exercises/REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated: A compound lower-body exercise. Keep back straight throughout."
}

###

### Delete an exercise
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/exercises/REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Search ExerciseDB (external API) and auto-import
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises/external/search?name=bench+press
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Import exercises by body part from ExerciseDB
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises/external/import/chest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### WORKOUT SESSION LOG SERVICE (Fares)
### ============================================================

### Get all sessions for the logged-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get sessions with date filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get workout history (last 20 sessions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/history?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Log a new workout session
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leg Day",
  "date": "2025-04-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseId": "REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID",
      "sets": 4,
      "reps": 8,
      "weight": 100
    },
    {
      "exerciseId": "REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID_2",
      "sets": 3,
      "reps": 12,
      "weight": 60
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get a single session by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update a session
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leg Day - Updated",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseId": "REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID",
      "sets": 5,
      "reps": 5,
      "weight": 120
    }
  ]
}

###

### Delete a session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### WORKOUT NOTES SERVICE (Saif)
### ============================================================

### Get all notes for a session
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/session/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add a note to a session
# @name createNote
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/session/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Felt strong today. Squats were smooth at 100kg. Need to work on depth."
}

###

### Get a single note by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update a note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated: Felt strong. Squats at 100kg. Good depth today. Increase weight next session."
}

###

### Delete a note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### PROGRESS & ANALYTICS SERVICE (Nemr)
### ============================================================

### Dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Weekly training volume (last 8 weeks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/volume/weekly?weeks=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Personal bests (max weight per exercise)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/personal-bests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Muscle group training frequency (last 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/frequency?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Progress over time for a specific exercise
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/progress/REPLACE_WITH_EXERCISE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### VALIDATION ERROR TESTS
### ============================================================

### Register with missing fields (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "x",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Create exercise with invalid muscle group (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "muscleGroup": "invalid_group"
}

###

### Log session with invalid exerciseId (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Session",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseId": "not-a-valid-id",
      "sets": 3,
      "reps": 10,
      "weight": 50
    }
  ]
}
